    "timeline.yesterday": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"昨日"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yesterday"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"昨天"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"어제"}}}},
    "tokenは作成直後に一度だけ表示され、サーバーにはhashだけを保存します。いつでもここから失効できます。": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"tokenは作成直後に一度だけ表示され、サーバーにはhashだけを保存します。いつでもここから失効できます。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The token is shown only once when created. Only its hash is stored on the server, and you can revoke it here at any time."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"token 只会在创建后显示一次。服务器仅保存其 hash，你可以随时在这里撤销它。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"token은 생성 직후 한 번만 표시되며 서버에는 hash만 저장됩니다. 언제든 여기에서 폐기할 수 있습니다."}}}},
    "upload.stage.completed": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記憶として残りました"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saved to your memories"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已留存为记忆"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기억으로 남았습니다"}}}},
    "upload.stage.compressing_photo": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"写真をきれいに整えています"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Optimizing your photo"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在优化照片"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"사진을 최적화하는 중"}}}},
    "upload.stage.compressing_video": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"音をそのままに、動画を軽くしています"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compressing video while preserving its audio"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在压缩视频并保留原始音频"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"소리는 그대로 유지하며 동영상을 줄이는 중"}}}},
    "upload.stage.finishing": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"あと少しです"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Almost done"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"即将完成"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"거의 다 됐어요"}}}},
    "upload.stage.importing": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記憶を受け取っています"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Receiving your memory"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在接收你的记忆"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기억을 받아오는 중"}}}},
    "upload.stage.retrying": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"もう一度届けています"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sending it again"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在再次送达"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"다시 전하는 중입니다"}}}},
    "upload.stage.uploading": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"あなたの残像として保存しています"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saving to your afterimage"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在保存为你的残像"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"내 잔상으로 저장하는 중"}}}},
    "upload.stage.waiting_to_retry": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"少し置いて、もう一度試します"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trying again in a moment"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"稍后会再试一次"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"잠시 후 다시 시도합니다"}}}},
    "うまくいきませんでした": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"うまくいきませんでした"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Something Went Wrong"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"出现了问题"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"문제가 발생했습니다"}}}},
    "ことば": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ことば"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Words"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"文字"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"말"}}}},
    "このAIとの接続を解除しますか？": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このAIとの接続を解除しますか？"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disconnect this AI?"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"要断开与此 AI 的连接吗？"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 AI와의 연결을 해제할까요?"}}}},
    "このtokenは閉じると二度と表示できません。まず下のボタンからAIへ設定を依頼してください。": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このtokenは閉じると二度と表示できません。まず下のボタンからAIへ設定を依頼してください。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This token cannot be shown again after you close this screen. Use the button below to ask your AI to configure it first."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"关闭此页面后，这个 token 将无法再次显示。请先通过下方按钮让 AI 完成设置。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 화면을 닫으면 token을 다시 볼 수 없습니다. 먼저 아래 버튼으로 AI에 설정을 요청하세요."}}}},
    "その他": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"その他"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"More"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更多"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"더 보기"}}}},
    "どのAIへ渡したtokenか分かる名前を付けます。": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"どのAIへ渡したtokenか分かる名前を付けます。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Give it a name that identifies which AI will use this token."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"起一个便于识别此 token 交给哪个 AI 的名称。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"어떤 AI에 전달한 token인지 알아볼 수 있는 이름을 입력하세요."}}}},
    "まだ接続していません": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"まだ接続していません"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No AI Connected Yet"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未连接 AI"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아직 연결된 AI가 없습니다"}}}},
    "アカウント": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アカウント"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Account"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"账户"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"계정"}}}},
    "キャンセル": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"キャンセル"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cancel"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"取消"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"취소"}}}},
    "コピー": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"コピー"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copy"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"复制"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"복사"}}}},
    "サインアウト": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"サインアウト"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sign Out"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"退出登录"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"로그아웃"}}}},
    "一度だけ表示されるtoken": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一度だけ表示されるtoken"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"One-time token"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅显示一次的 token"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"한 번만 표시되는 token"}}}},
    "下の＋から撮影するか動画を選ぶと、\n音を変えずに軽くして保存します。": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下の＋から撮影するか動画を選ぶと、\n音を変えずに軽くして保存します。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Record or choose a video with the + button below.\nWe’ll optimize it while preserving the original audio."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"通过下方的 + 拍摄或选择视频。\n我们会在保留原始音频的同时压缩并保存。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아래 + 버튼에서 동영상을 촬영하거나 선택하세요.\n소리는 그대로 유지하면서 용량을 줄여 저장합니다."}}}},
    "作成": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"作成"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Create"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"创建"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"생성"}}}},
    "例: Hermes": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"例: Hermes"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Example: Hermes"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"示例：Hermes"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"예: Hermes"}}}},
    "再読み込み": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"再読み込み"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reload"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新加载"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"새로고침"}}}},
    "写真と動画は非公開で保存されます。動画の音は変えません。": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"写真と動画は非公開で保存されます。動画の音は変えません。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your photos and videos stay private. Video audio is preserved."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"照片和视频将被私密保存，视频原声保持不变。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"사진과 동영상은 비공개로 저장되며 동영상의 소리는 변경하지 않습니다."}}}},
    "動画を追加": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"動画を追加"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Add Videos"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"添加视频"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"동영상 추가"}}}},
    "削除": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"削除"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Delete"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"删除"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"삭제"}}}},
    "動画の文字起こしだけを、あなたが許可したAIエージェントへ安全に渡します。写真や動画本体を書き換える権限はありません。": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"動画の文字起こしだけを、あなたが許可したAIエージェントへ安全に渡します。写真や動画本体を書き換える権限はありません。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only video transcripts are shared securely with AI agents you authorize. They cannot modify your photos or videos."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅将视频转写文本安全地提供给你授权的 AI 智能体。它们无权修改照片或视频本身。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"동영상의 텍스트 변환만 허용한 AI 에이전트에 안전하게 전달합니다. 사진이나 동영상 원본을 수정할 권한은 없습니다."}}}},
    "完了": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完了"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Done"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完成"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"완료"}}}},
    "手動設定": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手動設定"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manual Setup"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手动设置"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"수동 설정"}}}},
    "接続の準備ができました": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"接続の準備ができました"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ready to Connect"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"连接准备已完成"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연결 준비가 완료되었습니다"}}}},
    "接続を確認しています…": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"接続を確認しています…"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Checking connections…"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在检查连接…"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연결 확인 중…"}}}},
    "接続を解除": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"接続を解除"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disconnect"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"断开连接"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연결 해제"}}}},
    "接続中のAI": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"接続中のAI"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connected AI"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已连接的 AI"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연결된 AI"}}}},
    "接続名": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"接続名"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connection Name"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"连接名称"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연결 이름"}}}},
    "撮った日々が、あとから見つかる。": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"撮った日々が、あとから見つかる。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The days you captured, easy to find again."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"记录过的日子，日后都能找到。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기록한 일상을 나중에 다시 찾을 수 있어요."}}}},
    "文字起こし": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"文字起こし"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Transcript"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"转写文本"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"텍스트 변환"}}}},
    "文字起こしの読み取り専用": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"文字起こしの読み取り専用"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read-only transcript access"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅可读取转写文本"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"텍스트 변환 읽기 전용"}}}},
    "新しい接続を作ると、設定用tokenを一度だけ表示します。": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"新しい接続を作ると、設定用tokenを一度だけ表示します。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"When you create a connection, its setup token is shown only once."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"创建连接后，设置用 token 只会显示一次。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"새 연결을 만들면 설정용 token을 한 번만 표시합니다."}}}},
    "解除すると、設定済みのAIはすぐに文字起こしを読めなくなります。": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"解除すると、設定済みのAIはすぐに文字起こしを読めなくなります。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Once disconnected, the AI will immediately lose access to your transcripts."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"断开后，已设置的 AI 将立即无法读取转写文本。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연결을 해제하면 설정된 AI가 즉시 텍스트 변환을 읽을 수 없게 됩니다."}}}},
    "記憶を、AIが読めるように": {"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記憶を、AIが読めるように"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Let AI read your memories"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"让 AI 读取你的记忆"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI가 기억을 읽을 수 있도록"}}}},
